{"id":"pero","lemma":"pero","pos":"conj","rank":23,"glosses":["but","well well; so; well (used for emphasis)","expresses surprise"],"ipa":"/ˈpeɾo/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/18/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-pero.wav","examples":[{"text":"Perdona, pero ¿tú quién eres?","en":"Sorry, but who are you?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/850374","words":[{"g":"to pardon","l":"perdonar"},null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"}]},{"text":"Disculpe pero, ¿quién es usted?","en":"Excuse me, but who are you?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/523369","words":[{"g":"excuse me"},null,{"g":"who"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"you (formal)"}]},{"text":"¡Pero qué día!","en":"What a day!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/438665","words":[null,{"g":"what"},{"g":"day"}]},{"text":"¿Pero al menos lo has intentado?","en":"Did you ever try?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/850238","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"to try, to attempt","l":"intentar"}],"phrases":[[1,3,"at least, at minimum"]]},{"text":"Pero yo no tenía miedo.","en":"But I wasn't afraid.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636647","words":[null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"fear"}]}]}